\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces AquaVolt-AI end-to-end serverless MLOps architecture and multi-modal PIML pipeline. Containerized GitHub Actions virtual runners execute hourly via POSIX cron schedules (`0 * * * *`), querying multi-source satellite streams (Sentinel-2, ECOSTRESS, Sentinel-1), reanalysis meteorology (Open-Meteo), and greenhouse gas spectrometry (Sentinel-5P). Ingested telemetry feeds the feature extraction engine, passes through the Shallow U-Net and Residual Crop Coefficient MLP, persists into dual-tier cloud storage (compressed Parquet + Google Sheets ledger), and triggers automated weekly gradient descent re-training at zero hardware infrastructure cost (\$0 CAPEX).}}{11}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:system_arch}{{2}{11}{AquaVolt-AI end-to-end serverless MLOps architecture and multi-modal PIML pipeline. Containerized GitHub Actions virtual runners execute hourly via POSIX cron schedules (`0 * * * *`), querying multi-source satellite streams (Sentinel-2, ECOSTRESS, Sentinel-1), reanalysis meteorology (Open-Meteo), and greenhouse gas spectrometry (Sentinel-5P). Ingested telemetry feeds the feature extraction engine, passes through the Shallow U-Net and Residual Crop Coefficient MLP, persists into dual-tier cloud storage (compressed Parquet + Google Sheets ledger), and triggers automated weekly gradient descent re-training at zero hardware infrastructure cost (\$0 CAPEX)}{figure.2}{}}
